          {
            "title": "Class name",
            "id": 89046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf adlarının genellikle ilk harfi büyük, geri kalan harfleri küçük yazılır; buradaki <code>Person</code> gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Person</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Descriptive",
            "id": 88823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenlerde olduğu gibi, sınıfları da açıklayıcı şekilde adlandırmaya çalışırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Book</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenlerde olduğu gibi sınıflar için de açıklayıcı adlar seçersin.</p><p><code>Book</code> adlı bir sınıf oluşturmaya başla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"author\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Book</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Consistent",
            "id": 89048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenleri ve fonksiyonları adlandırırken olduğu gibi, öğeleri tutarlı bir şekilde adlandırmalı ve büyük-küçük harf kullanımına dikkat etmeliyiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>sayBye</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenler ve fonksiyonlarda olduğu gibi sınıf ve metotları tutarlı adlandırır, büyük-küçük harf kullanımına dikkat edersin.</p><p><code>teacher</code> üzerinde doğru metodu çağırarak kodun <code>Bye</code> yazdırmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Person\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sayHello\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>teacher</code>, ardından <code>sayBye</code>, <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Other features",
            "id": 88771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıfların dışındaki metotlar gibi, Python'ın yerleşik fonksiyonlarını ve temel özelliklerini kullanabilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"155\" /><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>i</code> ve son olarak <code>in</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıfların dışındaki metotlar gibi, Python'ın yerleşik fonksiyonlarını ve temel özelliklerini kullanabilirsin.</p><p>Bir örnek, kendi verilerine bir metodun içinden <code>self</code> ile erişir.</p><p>Kodun turtanın her malzemesini yazdırması için malzemeler üzerinde döngü oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"192\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_ingredients\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self.flavor\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print_ingredients</code>, ardından <code>for</code>, <code>self.ingredients</code> ve son olarak <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 88796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>class</code> anahtar sözcüğü eksik</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bu kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>class</code> anahtar sözcüğü eksik.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıf tanımı <code>class</code> anahtar sözcüğüyle başlar, ardından sınıfın adı ve iki nokta üst üste gelir.</p><p>İlk satır <code>Person():</code> şeklindedir. Kodun <code>Person</code> sınıfını tanımlayabilmesi için ne düzeltilmelidir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eksik <code>class</code> anahtar sözcüğünü ekleyip bir sınıf başlığı kullanmak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey, çünkü parantezler tek başına bir sınıf tanımlar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Person(29, 5)</code> çağrılırken <code>self</code> iletmek</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(jess.age)</code> ifadesini sınıf tanımının içine taşımak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eksik <code>class</code> anahtar sözcüğünü ekleyip bir sınıf başlığı kullanmak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 88794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verilen sınıfı değiştirmeden <code>Person</code> oluşturucusunu kaç değerle çağırabiliriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">2 öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir örnek oluşturduğunda Python <code>self</code> değerini otomatik olarak sağlar.</p><p>Çağrıyı <code>Person(29)</code> olarak değiştirirsen neden başarısız olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">age değerini sağlar ancak height için değer bırakmaz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">self değerini sağlar ancak age ve height için değer bırakmaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">height değerini sağlar ancak age için değer bırakmaz</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">age ve height öncesinde Person için bir değere ihtiyaç duyar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">age değerini sağlar ancak height için değer bırakmaz.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 88795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıfın içinde hangi Python çekirdek dili özelliklerini kullanabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python'ın tüm temel dil özellikleri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca değişkenler oluşturabiliyoruz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python'ın tüm temel dil özellikleri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python'ın tüm temel dil özelliklerini bir sınıfın içinde kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Bir sınıf metodunun listeyi işlemek için bir döngüye ve <code>if</code> ifadesine ihtiyacı var. Bu tasarım kullanılabilir mi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, metotlar bu temel Python özelliklerini kullanabilir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, bir sınıf değişken içerebilir ancak kontrol akışı içeremez</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, döngülere yalnızca sınıf tanımlarının dışında izin verilir</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Evet, ancak yalnızca döngü ve koşul metodun dışında yazılırsa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, metotlar bu temel Python özelliklerini kullanabilir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
